  "description": "### ..-&quot;&quot;-..-&quot;&quot;-..   (&gt;^^)&gt;   TEA GRAVEYARD &lt;(^^&lt;)  ..-&quot;&quot;-..-&quot;&quot;-..   \n\nWelcome adventurer! We are an active but relaxed guild based in europe. \nEveryone is welcome but raids take place in CET late afternoon. \n\nWhat we expect:\n- activity at least once a week\n- please try to contribute to our stockpile from time to time\n\n\n#### ..-&quot;&quot;-..-&quot;&quot; \\0/   We made it!!!   \\0/ &quot;&quot;-..-&quot;&quot;-..  \n\n**Thanks** to you all are we now able to build our **guild hall**. \nGreat job!\n**Let&#039;s keep going &lt;3**",
